                "text": "# Atlas fictional styling guide \u2014 v1, effective 2026-01-01\nRecommend only products currently in stock in the customer's chosen size. Respect the total outfit budget, not only the price of individual pieces. Use purchase preferences to suggest compatible colors and styles. For smart casual, combine a shirt or top with trousers or a skirt and optional footwear. For formal occasions use tailored separates or a dress. Ask for clarification when size, budget, or occasion is unknown. Do not infer sensitive traits from purchase history. Prices are EUR and include fictional tax. Product similarity does not guarantee fit.\n",
